  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 851488006144
    m_Localized: Warrior Vid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006145
    m_Localized: "This is the warrior. Long time no see, innit?\n\nthe dungeon is
      sealed and a few occasional monsters surfacing here and there aren\u2019t a
      problem (irl, not joking)\neveryone doesn\u2019t watch raw videos since the
      editing is better, and I wanted to keep the subs so\u2026 I just sent u a new
      contract! yayyy\nyou just do you, got it?\n\nbtw I rly wanna marry the princess\nbut
      they wont allow me if I dont fight another dragon :(\nbet the crowned one is
      the real evil bastard\nanyway I contacted the dark lord, liaisoned a new dragon,
      they are one helluva wild beast\nalmost summoned the whole local monster town\neventually
      the only one who\u2019s showing up is the blue dragon, their other friends
      are for next week\nI group dmed them already so good luck on the video\n\nattachment
      \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006146
    m_Localized: fluffy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006147
    m_Localized: "have u ever petted a white dragon before?\ni have\nfur so fluffy\nfluf.\nI
      told them that sleep inducing spells are dope, and they even got me a cloak
      as a favor.\nit says the bearer becomes immune to fire attacks?? but only if
      i got it earlier, the scenes would've looked way cooler. now it's useless so
      nvm\nstill it looks pretty cool on my shoulders\nthis time I told my subs that
      the video will go up this week, so just stick to the deadline btw should it
      be within this week or within next week if i want it this week? i have no idea\n\nattachment
      \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006148
    m_Localized: stubborn old man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006149
    m_Localized: "stubborn old man still doesn\u2019t give a shit\npeople don\u2019t
      take stuff like that just cus it looks cool and the king did??? oh sure he
      does\nthe princess said she likes fried stuff but u know what? i hate spattering
      grease and the cloak was supposed to be my apron and its all fucked up\nanyway
      i\u2019ll find a way so u do your job, plus do you know any skilled tanking
      wizards??\n\nattachment \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006150
    m_Localized: '[Worlds Movie Weaver] Celebrating the Defeat of the Evil Lord!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006151
    m_Localized: "This email is exclusively sent to members who have agreed to receive
      advertisement notifications.\r\n\r\nPromotion Target: Members of Manasoft Worlds
      Movie Weaver Free (Personal Use)\r\nPromotion Period: 5 days starting today\r\nPromotion
      Details:\r\nGain access to the paid feature \u201CSFX\u201D for free during
      the promotion period! One conversion per every campaign day!\r\n\r\nThe following
      functions are included in the promotion:\r\n\r\nNeed speed? Perfect for swift
      mobility. <b>Haste!</b>\r\nFast. Powerful. Spectacular. <b>Damage Boost! </b>\r\nThe
      one and only devastating smite. <b>Crit Hit! </b>\r\nThe new meta, back by
      popular demand! <b> Stun! </b>\r\n(NEW!) Speak, for I am the Holy Warrior\u2026
      <b> Berserk! </b>\r\n(NEW!) The strength to rise once more! <b> Second Wind!</b>\r\n\r\n50%
      discount on Manasoft Worlds Movie Weaver (VAT included. Annual or monthly billing)\r\nFind
      additional information about this promotion <u>here.</u>\r\n\r\n<u>Click here
      to claim your offer!</u>\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
